WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Sam, an editor, opens the Pricing page and clicks Comment.

00:02.500 --> 00:06.000
Comment mode is on. The block under the pointer is outlined.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Click a block to comment on it. The box shows which block it is.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Type the comment. Click a name to mention someone: they get an email.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.000
Whole page comments on the page itself instead of one block.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.500
Comment sent. Click Done commenting to browse normally again.
